&lt;p&gt;According to The New York Post, among those toasting &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; at the Forevermark bash were &lt;strong&gt;Ewan McGregor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Julia Stiles&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Lou Reed,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Jerry Seinfeld&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Martha Stewart&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Helena Christensen&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Donna Karan&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Diane von Furstenberg&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Ivanka Trump&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Patti Smith &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Eve&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Last Monday, after the premiere of &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; hit up the Top of the Standard for the Cinema  Society bash, which turned into a late-night dance-off that had &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; on  the floor with her dancers and boyfriend &lt;strong&gt;Brahim Zaibat &lt;/strong&gt;until 2 a.m.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;According to The New York Post, among those toasting &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; at the Forevermark bash were &lt;strong&gt;Ewan McGregor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Julia Stiles&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Lou Reed,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Jerry Seinfeld&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Martha Stewart&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Helena Christensen&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Donna Karan&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Diane von Furstenberg&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Ivanka Trump&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Patti Smith &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Eve&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
